{"route":"/docs/6.0/components/toggler/","version":"6.0","renderedVersion":"6.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Toggler","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Toggle attributes or classes on click using only data attributes and our JavaScript plugin. Works with any attribute except <code>id</code>."},"blocks":[{"id":"content--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Toggler is a pure JavaScript component that can be used to avoid writing small or one-off JavaScript snippets to create interactive elements. Instead of writing custom JavaScript, use data attributes to toggle attribute values, changes classes, and more on <code>click</code> events."},{"id":"examples","type":"heading","en":"Examples","level":2},{"id":"toggle-class","type":"heading","en":"Toggle class","level":3},{"id":"toggle-class--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Toggle the class of an element by adding the <code>data-bs-toggle=&quot;toggler&quot;</code> attribute to the element and the <code>data-bs-value</code> attribute to the value you want to toggle."},{"id":"toggle-class--example-1","type":"demo","key":"7a7b540f252c92b9a3f8","height":147},{"id":"toggle-class--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"w-100 p-3 rounded border\"\n     data-bs-toggle=\"toggler\"\n     data-bs-value=\"fg-danger\"\n     data-bs-attribute=\"class\">\n  Click to toggle `fg-danger`\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"remove-existing","type":"heading","en":"Remove existing","level":3},{"id":"remove-existing--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"If the element already has the class specified in <code>data-bs-value</code>, toggling will remove it. Clicking again adds it back."},{"id":"remove-existing--example-1","type":"demo","key":"bee4388d4e715377c780","height":147},{"id":"remove-existing--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"w-100 p-3 rounded border bg-subtle-info\"\n     data-bs-toggle=\"toggler\"\n     data-bs-value=\"bg-subtle-info\"\n     data-bs-attribute=\"class\">\n  Starts with `bg-subtle-info`. Click to remove it.\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"target-element","type":"heading","en":"Target element","level":3},{"id":"target-element--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use <code>data-bs-toggle</code> with <code>data-bs-target</code> to toggle the class of another element."},{"id":"target-element--example-1","type":"demo","key":"a4f3b6785b3c3c180ca5","height":174,"anchors":["togglerExample1"]},{"id":"target-element--code-1","type":"code","value":"<button class=\"btn-solid theme-primary\" data-bs-toggle=\"toggler\" data-bs-target=\"#togglerExample1\">Toggle</button>\n\n<div id=\"togglerExample1\" class=\"w-100 p-3 rounded border\" data-bs-value=\"bg-2\" data-bs-attribute=\"class\">\n  Use button to change `bg-2`\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"multiple-elements","type":"heading","en":"Multiple elements","level":3},{"id":"multiple-elements--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use <code>data-bs-toggle</code> with a class name selector in <code>data-bs-target</code> to toggle the class of multiple elements."},{"id":"multiple-elements--example-1","type":"demo","key":"783dabd3fc35207d47e5","height":201},{"id":"multiple-elements--code-1","type":"code","value":"<button class=\"btn-solid theme-primary align-self-start\"\n        data-bs-toggle=\"toggler\" data-bs-target=\".togglerExampleClass1\">Toggle</button>\n\n<div class=\"w-100 p-3 rounded border togglerExampleClass1\"\n     data-bs-value=\"bg-subtle-info\"\n     data-bs-attribute=\"class\">\n  Use button to toggle `bg-subtle-info`\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"w-100 p-3 rounded border togglerExampleClass1\"\n     data-bs-value=\"bg-subtle-warning\"\n     data-bs-attribute=\"class\">\n  Use button to toggle `bg-subtle-warning`\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"toggle-attribute","type":"heading","en":"Toggle attribute","level":3},{"id":"toggle-attribute--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Toggle attributes by using the <code>data-bs-toggle</code> attribute with the <code>data-bs-attribute</code> and <code>data-bs-value</code> attributes. For example, toggling the <code>hidden</code> attribute:"},{"id":"toggle-attribute--example-1","type":"demo","key":"634584ce23ddef8aba23","height":147},{"id":"toggle-attribute--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"w-100 p-3 rounded border\"\n     data-bs-toggle=\"toggler\"\n     data-bs-value=\"true\"\n     data-bs-attribute=\"hidden\">\n  Click to toggle `hidden` attribute\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"toggle-attribute--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"You could also use this to toggle the <code>disabled</code> attribute on a <code>fieldset</code> element to disable all the controls within. Or any other ideas you can think of with attributes."},{"id":"usage","type":"heading","en":"Usage","level":2},{"id":"via-data-attributes","type":"heading","en":"Via data attributes","level":3},{"id":"via-data-attributes--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add <code>data-bs-toggle=&quot;toggler&quot;</code> to the element to automatically. The <code>data-bs-target</code> is optional, and attribute accepts a CSS selector to apply the toggler functionality to. Be sure to add the <code>data-bs-attribute</code> and <code>data-bs-value</code> attributes to the toggled element’s markup."},{"id":"via-data-attributes--table-1","type":"table","caption":[],"rows":[{"head":true,"cells":[{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"via-data-attributes--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Attribute"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"via-data-attributes--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Description"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"via-data-attributes--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>data-bs-toggle=&quot;toggler&quot;</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"via-data-attributes--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"Initializes the toggler on the trigger element."}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"via-data-attributes--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>data-bs-target</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"via-data-attributes--paragraph-7","type":"paragraph","en":"Optional CSS selector for the element whose attribute is toggled."}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"via-data-attributes--paragraph-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>data-bs-attribute</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"via-data-attributes--paragraph-9","type":"paragraph","en":"Name of the HTML attribute to toggle (e.g. <code>hidden</code>, <code>disabled</code>)."}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"via-data-attributes--paragraph-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>data-bs-value</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"via-data-attributes--paragraph-11","type":"paragraph","en":"Value to set when the attribute is “on” (often paired with removal when “off”)."}]}]}]},{"id":"via-javascript","type":"heading","en":"Via JavaScript","level":3},{"id":"via-javascript--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"We don’t recommend using this component programmatically, as the initial purpose of it is to avoid using JavaScript. However, you can enable manually with:"},{"id":"via-javascript--code-1","type":"code","value":"var togglerElementList = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('[data-bs-toggle=\"toggler\"]'))\nvar togglerList = togglerElementList.map(function (togglerEl) {\n  return new bootstrap.Toggler(togglerEl)\n})","language":""},{"id":"dependencies","type":"heading","en":"Dependencies","level":3},{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"The toggler plugin requires the following JavaScript files if you’re building Bootstrap’s JS from source:"},{"id":"dependencies--table-1","type":"table","caption":[],"rows":[{"head":true,"cells":[{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"File"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Description"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>js/src/toggler.ts</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"Main toggler component"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>js/src/base-component.ts</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-7","type":"paragraph","en":"Base component class"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>js/src/dom/data.ts</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-9","type":"paragraph","en":"Element data store"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>js/src/dom/event-handler.ts</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-11","type":"paragraph","en":"Event handling utilities"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>js/src/dom/manipulator.ts</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-13","type":"paragraph","en":"Data attribute manipulation"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-14","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>js/src/dom/selector-engine.ts</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-15","type":"paragraph","en":"DOM selector utilities"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-16","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>js/src/util/component-functions.ts</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-17","type":"paragraph","en":"Shared component helpers"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-18","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>js/src/util/config.ts</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-19","type":"paragraph","en":"Configuration base class"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-20","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>js/src/util/index.ts</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-21","type":"paragraph","en":"Core utility functions"}]}]}]},{"id":"options","type":"heading","en":"Options","level":3},{"id":"options--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Options can be passed via data attributes or JavaScript. For data attributes, append the option name to <code>data-bs-</code>, as in <code>data-bs-value=&quot;foo&quot;</code>."},{"id":"options--table-1","type":"table","caption":[],"rows":[{"head":true,"cells":[{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Name"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Type"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"Default"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"Description"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>attribute</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-7","type":"paragraph","en":"string"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>class</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-9","type":"paragraph","en":"The attribute which will be toggled on each click"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>value</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-11","type":"paragraph","en":"string, number, boolean, null"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-12","type":"paragraph","en":"null"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-13","type":"paragraph","en":"The value to toggle for the given attribute, such as a class name. Toggling is a no-op when no value is set."}]}]}]},{"id":"methods","type":"heading","en":"Methods","level":3},{"id":"methods--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"You can create a toggler instance using the constructor, for example:"},{"id":"methods--code-1","type":"code","value":"var myToggler = document.getElementById('myToggler')\nvar bsToggler = new bootstrap.Toggler(myToggler)","language":""},{"id":"methods--table-1","type":"table","caption":[],"rows":[{"head":true,"cells":[{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"methods--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Method"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"methods--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Description"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"methods--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>toggle</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"methods--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"Toggles a toggler element chosen attribute"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"methods--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>getInstance</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"methods--paragraph-7","type":"paragraph","en":"<em>Static</em> method which allows you to get the toggler instance associated with a DOM element"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"methods--paragraph-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>getOrCreateInstance</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"methods--paragraph-9","type":"paragraph","en":"<em>Static</em> method which allows you to get the toggler instance associated with a DOM element, or create a new one in case it wasn’t initialized"}]}]}]},{"id":"events","type":"heading","en":"Events","level":3},{"id":"events--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Bootstrap’s toggler class exposes a few events for hooking into toggler functionality."},{"id":"events--table-1","type":"table","caption":[],"rows":[{"head":true,"cells":[{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Event type"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Description"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>toggle.bs.toggler</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"This event fires immediately when the <code>toggle</code> instance method is called."}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>toggled.bs.toggler</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-7","type":"paragraph","en":"This event is fired when the instance’s element attribute has been changed."}]}]}]},{"id":"events--code-1","type":"code","value":"var myToggler = document.getElementById('myToggler')\nmyToggler.addEventListener('toggle.bs.toggler', function () {\n  // do something...\n})","language":""}],"demos":[{"key":"7a7b540f252c92b9a3f8","html":"<div class=\"w-100 p-3 rounded border\" data-bs-toggle=\"toggler\" data-bs-value=\"fg-danger\" data-bs-attribute=\"class\">\n  Click to toggle `fg-danger`\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"bee4388d4e715377c780","html":"<div class=\"w-100 p-3 rounded border bg-subtle-info\" data-bs-toggle=\"toggler\" data-bs-value=\"bg-subtle-info\" data-bs-attribute=\"class\">\n  Starts with `bg-subtle-info`. Click to remove it.\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"a4f3b6785b3c3c180ca5","html":"<button class=\"btn-solid theme-primary\" data-bs-toggle=\"toggler\" data-bs-target=\"#togglerExample1\">Toggle</button>\n\n<div id=\"togglerExample1\" class=\"w-100 p-3 rounded border\" data-bs-value=\"bg-2\" data-bs-attribute=\"class\">\n  Use button to change `bg-2`\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example d-flex gap-2 flex-column align-items-start"},"sprite":""},{"key":"783dabd3fc35207d47e5","html":"<button class=\"btn-solid theme-primary align-self-start\" data-bs-toggle=\"toggler\" data-bs-target=\".togglerExampleClass1\">Toggle</button>\n\n<div class=\"w-100 p-3 rounded border togglerExampleClass1\" data-bs-value=\"bg-subtle-info\" data-bs-attribute=\"class\">\n  Use button to toggle `bg-subtle-info`\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"w-100 